    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Set the measure first</h3>
    <p class="mt-2">Long lines tire the eye, so readers lose their place on the way back. Keep body text at <x-markas.text-highlighter>45 to 75 characters</x-markas.text-highlighter> per line, give it a <x-markas.text-highlighter :delay="400">line height near 1.5</x-markas.text-highlighter>, and let headings sit <x-markas.text-highlighter :delay="800">closer to the text they introduce</x-markas.text-highlighter> than to the one above.</p>
